{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2025-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1756684800, "end_date": 1757289599, "month_true_total": 78, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:07:20 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "203817316", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970966290", "personaname": "Hausmeister", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hausmeister/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 437, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 437, "last_played": 1757267936, "avatar": "5434ce5d3de3d247e8b2b73d3174fa00f9e151e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played this in 2025. It has aged okay in most regards, except for some gamplay decsisions that can cause death for the only reason that you are unlucky. \nGraphics are dated but overall not bad, good design and it was the least of any issues.\nControls on PC are confusing only until you rebind in the main menu. \nThe difficulty is mostly ok on normal, but I will say that (basic) ranged enemies deal a lot of damage, especially in the late game. And everyone is aiming for Titus. It was a bit frustrating near the end, some gameplay mechanics (like the player being vulnerable during the execution sequences... which you need to regain health) often the cause of death rather than player error. \n\nOverall I don't regret serving the emperor.", "timestamp_created": 1757268659, "timestamp_updated": 1757268659, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.612119615077972412", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203809086", "author": {"steamid": "76561199021375763", "personaname": "Gary SiN", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Retr0SiN/", "num_games_owned": 941, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 742, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 671, "last_played": 1759882889, "avatar": "4f73f1c58eb263349c3b4f7ca07aa6f9241e9812"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game, pisses me off", "timestamp_created": 1757262576, "timestamp_updated": 1757262576, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203805287", "author": {"steamid": "76561198299772888", "personaname": "Madgooo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/drmadgooo/", "num_games_owned": 287, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 632, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 632, "last_played": 1757250293, "avatar": "181025648d801aa9bce17fbd7479459df5fc242a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Campain - Love it, these older games have soul you are completely invested. Not a warhammer lover or hater, the game is just good. Point of the game is simple you know why you are doing objectives, no sneaking just doing ultramarine things and looking cool and calm all the time. Multiplayer - good luck\r\nIt is something like third person doom\r\nRating 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1757259973, "timestamp_updated": 1757259973, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203750543", "author": {"steamid": "76561199109706568", "personaname": "deatheater123", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199109706568/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 564, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 564, "deck_playtime_at_review": 564, "last_played": 1757037697, "avatar": "94911ef404acb12bfc1f9191cf005ac861b8a3ae"}, "language": "english", "review": "For a game over 10 years old, its still pretty good. The executions are satisfying and a variety of weapons to choose and enemies to fight. \n\nThat being said the campaign is short, having completed it in less than 10 hours. Definitely a buy on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1757210436, "timestamp_updated": 1757210436, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203728434", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072358077", "personaname": "CoffeeGoblin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072358077/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 648, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 229, "last_played": 1757882937, "avatar": "5261bbb3579392b1b846981f6e83a00ac9dcedda"}, "language": "english", "review": "For the Emperor!", "timestamp_created": 1757188646, "timestamp_updated": 1757188646, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}